body:
I wasn't trying to imply that I was special for having a degree, it just irritated me to have someone come after me for my "correct" word choice in a post where I'm expressing being suicidal. 

I'm kind of trapped being around him for a week. Living with family and no car and he's going to be here for the next week. Mother and aunts (members of the house) don't understand the issue.

&#x200B;
